<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Course Description</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  body {
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <h1 style="font-size: 24pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">Course description</h1>
  <h2 style="font-size: 20pt; margin-top: 0;">T315F</h2>
  <h1 style="font-size: 24pt; margin-top: 0;">System 800xA with AC 800M</h1>
  <h2 style="font-size: 20pt; margin-top: 0;">Engineering, Part 1 – Function Designer</h2>

  <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 20px;">Course goal</h3>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt;">The goal of this course is to learn the engineering of a complete control project using the Extended Automation System 800xA with AC 800M controllers and Function Designer as the engineering tool. Note that this course is split in two parts and the follow-up course is T315H for the Human System Interface (HSI) configuration.</p>

  <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 20px;">Learning objectives</h3>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt;">Upon completion of this course the participants will be able to:</p>
  <ul style="font-size: 11pt; padding-left: 20px;">
    <li><span data-field="learning_objectives[0]">{{ learning_objectives[0] }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="learning_objectives[1]">{{ learning_objectives[1] }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="learning_objectives[2]">{{ learning_objectives[2] }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="learning_objectives[3]">{{ learning_objectives[3] }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="learning_objectives[4]">{{ learning_objectives[4] }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="learning_objectives[5]">{{ learning_objectives[5] }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="learning_objectives[6]">{{ learning_objectives[6] }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="learning_objectives[7]">{{ learning_objectives[7] }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="learning_objectives[8]">{{ learning_objectives[8] }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="learning_objectives[9]">{{ learning_objectives[9] }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="learning_objectives[10]">{{ learning_objectives[10] }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="learning_objectives[11]">{{ learning_objectives[11] }}</span></li>
  </ul>

  <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 20px;">Topics</h3>
  <ul style="font-size: 11pt; padding-left: 20px;">
    <li><span data-field="topics[0]">{{ topics[0] }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="topics[1]">{{ topics[1] }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="topics[2]">{{ topics[2] }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="topics[3]">{{ topics[3] }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="topics[4]">{{ topics[4] }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="topics[5]">{{ topics[5] }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="topics[6]">{{ topics[6] }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="topics[7]">{{ topics[7] }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="topics[8]">{{ topics[8] }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="topics[9]">{{ topics[9] }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="topics[10]">{{ topics[10] }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="topics[11]">{{ topics[11] }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="topics[12]">{{ topics[12] }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="topics[13]">{{ topics[13] }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="topics[14]">{{ topics[14] }}</span></li>
  </ul>

  <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 20px;">Course type and methods</h3>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt;">This is an instructor led course with interactive classroom discussions and associated lab exercises. Approximately <span data-field="course_duration_percentage">{{ course_duration_percentage }}</span> of the course is hands-on lab activities.</p>

  <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 20px;">Duration</h3>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt;">The duration is <span data-field="course_duration_text">{{ course_duration_text }}</span>.</p>

  <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 20px;">Participant profile</h3>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt;">This training is targeted to system and application engineers, commissioning and maintenance personnel, service engineers and system integrators.</p>

  <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 20px;">Prerequisites</h3>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt;">Students shall know the fundamentals of working with Control Systems and have basic knowledge of Windows XP and networking technologies.</p>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end;">
    <div style="text-align: left;">
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">ABB University, <span data-field="address_line_1">{{ address_line_1 }}</span></p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Tel: +<span data-field="phone_country_code">{{ phone_country_code }}</span>(<span data-field="phone_area_code">{{ phone_area_code }}</span>)<span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span></p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Email: <span data-field="email_address">{{ email_address }}</span></p>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <p style="font-size: 10pt; text-align: right;">Power and productivity</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt; text-align: right;">for a better world™</p>
      <img src="" alt="ABB Logo" style="width: 100px; height: auto; float: right; margin-top: 10px;">
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

